<title>FRANCE: Rhone assets sales six billion Ffr.</title>
<headline>Rhone assets sales six billion Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc said on Friday that by September 30 it had sold six billion francs in non-strategic assets, out of its planned 10 billion franc divestment programme.</p>
<p>The company said in a results statement that the ratio of net debt to equity had been brought down to 0.63, versus 0.72 at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
